     "severity": "HIGH",
     "category": "[be-services] Race condition",
     "section": "scripts/lib/fleet/rollup-land.mjs: closeBoundToHead",
     "detail": "If a contributor pushes a new commit after the initial head read but before `gh pr close`, cleanup closes a PR containing work that did not land. The second read can detect the mismatch, but it cannot prevent the destructive close; a crash or failed read can also prevent the warning from being delivered.",
     "_hash": "8942d7a7",
