     "category": "[Sustainability] Cleanup reconciliation",
     "section": "scripts/lib/fleet/rollup-land.mjs — closeBoundToHead",
     "detail": "If the post-close read detects that the head moved, the function returns a failure warning. On the next run, however, the non-OPEN check returns `closed` before comparing the head, clearing that warning even though the PR may contain work that did not land.",
